    "group": "Assimilation Swarm",
    "summary": "Each friendly HARVESTER can use regeneration during your Command phase on one TYRANIDS unit from your army within 6\". A recipient can get this benefit just once that phase. Choose a recovery for each. On one model, heal a maximum of D3+1 lost wounds. For INFANTRY, you can instead restore a destroyed model at full wounds, excluding CHARACTERS. An ENDLESS MULTITUDE unit can use the return option for as many as 3 models.",
